    },
    "distinct_theories": {
      "status": "scored",
      "score": 2,
      "event_ids": ["A4", "A5"],
      "reason": "T1 (productivity at price parity, broad households) and T2 (status or lifestyle, affluent buyers, specialty and luxury channels) are rival explanations with somewhat different customers and channels. Both assume the same home storage kit product, so they do not reach rung 3."
